---
// 25px band between two full-bleed hairlines, with tick marks where it crosses the column guides.
// Drop it anywhere inside the page column; it reaches out over the column borders and screen edges itself.
---

<div aria-hidden="true" class="relative -mx-[2px] h-[27px]">
	<span class="absolute inset-x-[-50vw] top-0 h-[2px] bg-line"></span>
	<span class="absolute inset-x-[-50vw] bottom-0 h-[2px] bg-line"></span>

	<span class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[6px] w-[2px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[6px] w-[2px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-[2px] w-[6px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[2px] w-[6px] bg-tick"></span>

	<span class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-[6px] w-[2px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[6px] w-[2px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-[2px] w-[6px] bg-tick"></span>
	<span class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[2px] w-[6px] bg-tick"></span>
</div>
